#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.html
#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.txt
msgid ""
"Here are some tips for keeping your Zulip conversations organized with "
"topics."
msgstr ""
"Aquí teniu alguns consells per mantenir ordenades les converses de Zulip amb "
"temes."

#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.html
msgid ""
"In Zulip, <b>channels</b> determine who gets a message. <b>Topics</b> tell "
"you what the message is about."
msgstr ""
"A Zulip, els <b>canals</b> determinen qui rep un missatge. Els <b>temes</b> "
"indiquen de què tracta el missatge."

#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.html
#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.txt
msgid ""
"Using topics, you can read Zulip one conversation at a time. You'll see each "
"message in context, no matter how many different discussions are going on."
msgstr ""
"Amb els temes, podeu llegir Zulip una conversa darrere l'altra. Veureu cada "
"missatge en context, per moltes discussions diferents que hi hagi en marxa."

#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.html
msgid "Channels and topics in the Zulip app"
msgstr "Canals i temes a l'aplicació de Zulip"

#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.html
#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.txt
msgid ""
"To kick off a new conversation, just pick a channel and start a new topic. "
"This way, the new conversation thread won't interrupt ongoing discussions. "
"For a good topic name, think about finishing the sentence: “Hey, can we chat "
"about…?”"
msgstr ""
"Per iniciar una conversa nova, només cal triar un canal i començar un tema "
"nou. Així, el fil de la conversa nova no interromprà les discussions en "
"curs. Per posar un bon nom al tema, imagineu que heu d'acabar la frase: «Ei, "
"podem parlar de…?»"

#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.html
msgid "Examples of short topics"
msgstr "Exemples de temes curts"

#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Don't stress about picking the perfect name for your topic. If anything is "
"out of place, it's easy to <a href=\"%(move_messages_link)s\">move messages</"
"a>, <a href=\"%(rename_topics_link)s\">rename topics</a>, or even <a "
"href=\"%(move_channels_link)s\">move a topic to a different channel</a>."
msgstr ""
"No us amoïneu per triar el nom perfecte del tema. Si alguna cosa no és al "
"lloc que toca, és fàcil <a href=\"%(move_messages_link)s\">moure missatges</"
"a>, <a href=\"%(rename_topics_link)s\">canviar el nom dels temes</a> o fins "
"i tot <a href=\"%(move_channels_link)s\">moure un tema a un altre canal</a>."

#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.html
#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.txt
#: templates/zerver/portico-header-dropdown.html
msgid "Go to Zulip"
msgstr "Ves a Zulip"

#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.subject.txt
msgid "Keep your conversations organized with topics"
msgstr "Mantingueu ordenades les converses amb temes"

#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.txt
msgid ""
"In Zulip, channels determine who gets a message. Topics tell you what the "
"message is about."
msgstr ""
"A Zulip, els canals determinen qui rep un missatge. Els temes indiquen de "
"què tracta el missatge."

#: templates/zerver/emails/onboarding_zulip_topics.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Don't stress about picking the perfect name for your topic. If anything is "
"out of place, it's easy to move messages (%(move_messages_link)s), rename "
"topics (%(rename_topics_link)s), or even move a topic to a different channel "
"(%(move_channels_link)s)."
msgstr ""
"No us amoïneu per triar el nom perfecte del tema. Si alguna cosa no és al "
"lloc que toca, és fàcil moure missatges (%(move_messages_link)s), canviar el "
"nom dels temes (%(rename_topics_link)s) o fins i tot moure un tema a un "
"altre canal (%(move_channels_link)s)."

