#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can [download](/apps/) the [mobile and desktop apps](/apps/).\n"
"Zulip also works great in a browser.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Podeu [baixar](/apps/) les [aplicacions per a mòbil i escriptori](/apps/).\n"
"Zulip també funciona molt bé en un navegador.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"Go to [Profile settings](#settings/profile) to add a [profile picture](/help/"
"change-your-profile-picture)\n"
"and edit your [profile information](/help/edit-your-profile).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Aneu a la [configuració del perfil](#settings/profile) per afegir una [foto "
"de perfil](/help/change-your-profile-picture)\n"
"i editar la [informació del perfil](/help/edit-your-profile).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can switch between [light and dark theme](/help/dark-theme), [pick your\n"
"favorite emoji set](/help/emoji-and-emoticons#change-your-emoji-set), "
"[change\n"
"your language](/help/change-your-language), and otherwise customize your "
"Zulip\n"
"experience in your [Preferences](#settings/preferences).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Podeu canviar entre el [tema clar i el fosc](/help/dark-theme), [triar el "
"conjunt\n"
"d'emojis preferit](/help/emoji-and-emoticons#change-your-emoji-set), "
"[canviar\n"
"la llengua](/help/change-your-language) i personalitzar d'altres maneres "
"l'experiència\n"
"de Zulip a les [preferències](#settings/preferences).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Channels organize conversations based on who needs to see them. For "
"example,\n"
"it's common to have a channel for each team in an organization.\n"
"\n"
"[Browse and subscribe to channels]({settings_link}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Els canals organitzen les converses segons qui les ha de veure. Per "
"exemple,\n"
"sol ser habitual tenir un canal per a cada equip d'una organització.\n"
"\n"
"[Explora els canals i subscriu-te'n]({settings_link}).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"[Topics](/help/introduction-to-topics) summarize what each conversation in "
"Zulip\n"
"is about. You can read Zulip one topic at a time, seeing each message in\n"
"context, no matter how many other conversations are going on.\n"
"\n"
"When you start a conversation, label it with a new topic. For a good topic "
"name,\n"
"think about finishing the sentence: “Hey, can we chat about…?”\n"
"\n"
"Check out [Recent conversations](#recent) for a list of topics that are "
"being\n"
"discussed.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Els [temes](/help/introduction-to-topics) resumeixen de què tracta cada "
"conversa de Zulip.\n"
"Podeu llegir Zulip un tema cada cop, veient cada missatge en context,\n"
"per moltes altres converses que hi hagi en marxa.\n"
"\n"
"Quan comenceu una conversa, etiqueteu-la amb un tema nou. Per posar un bon "
"nom al tema,\n"
"imagineu que heu d'acabar la frase: «Ei, podem parlar de…?»\n"
"\n"
"Consulteu les [converses recents](#recent) per veure la llista de temes que "
"s'estan\n"
"discutint.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"Zulip's [keyboard shortcuts](#keyboard-shortcuts) let you navigate the app\n"
"quickly and efficiently.\n"
"\n"
"Press `?` any time to see a [cheat sheet](#keyboard-shortcuts).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Les [dreceres de teclat](#keyboard-shortcuts) de Zulip us permeten navegar "
"per l'aplicació\n"
"de manera ràpida i eficient.\n"
"\n"
"Premeu `?` en qualsevol moment per veure una [xuleta](#keyboard-shortcuts).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can **format** *your* `message` using the handy formatting buttons, or "
"by\n"
"typing your formatting with Markdown.\n"
"\n"
"Check out the [cheat sheet](#message-formatting) to learn about spoilers, "
"global\n"
"times, and more.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Podeu donar **format** al *vostre* `missatge` amb els botons de format, o\n"
"escrivint el format amb Markdown.\n"
"\n"
"Consulteu la [xuleta](#message-formatting) per saber més sobre contingut "
"ocult, hores\n"
"globals i més coses.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Here are a few messages I understand: {bot_commands}\n"
"\n"
"Check out our [Getting started guide](/help/getting-started-with-zulip),\n"
"or browse the [help center](/help/) to learn more!\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Aquests són alguns dels missatges que entenc: {bot_commands}\n"
"\n"
"Consulteu la nostra [guia d'introducció](/help/getting-started-with-zulip)\n"
"o exploreu el [centre d'ajuda](/help/) per saber-ne més!\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can chat with me as much as you like! To\n"
"get help, try one of the following messages: {bot_commands}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Podeu xerrar amb mi tant com volgueu! Per\n"
"obtenir ajuda, proveu un d'aquests missatges: {bot_commands}\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"If anything is out of place, it’s easy to [move messages]"
"({move_content_another_topic_help_url}),\n"
"[rename]({rename_topic_help_url}) and [split]"
"({move_content_another_topic_help_url}) topics,\n"
"or even move a topic [to a different channel]"
"({move_content_another_channel_help_url}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Si alguna cosa no és al lloc que toca, és fàcil [moure missatges]"
"({move_content_another_topic_help_url}),\n"
"[canviar el nom]({rename_topic_help_url}) dels temes i [dividir-los]"
"({move_content_another_topic_help_url}),\n"
"o fins i tot moure un tema [a un altre canal]"
"({move_content_another_channel_help_url}).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
":point_right: Try moving this message to another topic and back.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
":point_right: Proveu de moure aquest missatge a un altre tema i tornar-lo a "
"posar aquí.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Zulip is organized to help you communicate more efficiently. Conversations "
"are\n"
"labeled with topics, which summarize what the conversation is about.\n"
"\n"
"For example, this message is in the “{topic_name}” topic in the\n"
"#**{zulip_discussion_channel_name}** channel, as you can see in the left "
"sidebar\n"
"and above.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Zulip està organitzat per ajudar-vos a comunicar-vos amb més eficiència. Les "
"converses s'etiqueten\n"
"amb temes, que resumeixen de què tracta la conversa.\n"
"\n"
"Per exemple, aquest missatge és al tema «{topic_name}» del\n"
"canal #**{zulip_discussion_channel_name}**, tal com podeu veure a la barra "
"lateral esquerra\n"
"i a dalt.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid "welcome to Zulip!"
msgstr "us donem la benvinguda a Zulip!"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can read Zulip one conversation at a time, seeing each message in "
"context,\n"
"no matter how many other conversations are going on.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Podeu llegir Zulip una conversa cada cop, veient cada missatge en context,\n"
"per moltes altres converses que hi hagi en marxa.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
":point_right: When you're ready, check out your [Inbox](/#inbox) for other\n"
"conversations with unread messages.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
":point_right: Quan estigueu a punt, consulteu la [safata d'entrada](/#inbox) "
"per veure altres\n"
"converses amb missatges no llegits.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"To kick off a new conversation, pick a channel in the left sidebar, and "
"click\n"
"the `+` button next to its name.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Per iniciar una conversa nova, trieu un canal a la barra lateral esquerra i "
"feu clic\n"
"al botó `+` que hi ha al costat del nom.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"Label your conversation with a topic. Think about finishing the sentence: "
"“Hey,\n"
"can we chat about…?”\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Etiqueteu la conversa amb un tema. Penseu a acabar la frase: «Ei,\n"
"podem parlar de…?»\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
":point_right: Try starting a new conversation in this channel.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
":point_right: Proveu d'iniciar una conversa nova en aquest canal.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
":point_right:  Use this topic to try out [Zulip's messaging features]"
"({format_message_help_url}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
":point_right:  Feu servir aquest tema per provar les [funcions de "
"missatgeria de Zulip]({format_message_help_url}).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"```spoiler Want to see some examples?\n"
"\n"
"````python\n"
"\n"
"print(\"code blocks\")\n"
"\n"
"````\n"
"\n"
"- bulleted\n"
"- lists\n"
"\n"
"Link to a conversation: #**{zulip_discussion_channel_name}>{topic_name}**\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"```spoiler Voleu veure alguns exemples?\n"
"\n"
"````python\n"
"\n"
"print(\"blocs de codi\")\n"
"\n"
"````\n"
"\n"
"- amb pics\n"
"- llistes\n"
"\n"
"Enllaç a una conversa: #**{zulip_discussion_channel_name}>{topic_name}**\n"
"\n"
"```\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"This **greetings** topic is a great place to say “hi” :wave: to your "
"teammates.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Aquest tema de **salutacions** és un bon lloc per dir «hola» :wave: als "
"companys d'equip.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
":point_right: Click on this message to start a new message in the same "
"conversation.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
":point_right: Feu clic en aquest missatge per començar un missatge nou a la "
"mateixa conversa.\n"

